{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00459","headline":"郊庙歌辞 五郊乐章 赤帝徵音 雍和 · 魏徵","name":"郊庙歌辞 五郊乐章 赤帝徵音 雍和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昭昭丹陆，奕奕炎方。\n礼陈牲币，乐备篪簧。\n琼羞溢俎，玉醑浮觞。\n恭惟正直，歆此馨香。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"魏徵","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00459.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00459","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}